    <code code="11450-4" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Problem List"/>
    <title>Problems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>Problem</th><th>Clinical status</th><th>Verification</th><th>Code</th><th>Provenance</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Essential hypertension, stage 2, with mild concentric left ventricular hypertrophy; synthetic modern diagnosis linked to his documented high blood pressure</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>I10</td><td>S — Synthetic modern diagnosis confirmed by office and home readings; his high blood pressure is documented in his health file and his own letter (D).</td>
